      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 2]"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0040_doctor_04",
      "hash": "d72bd97e07085f95",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 3]"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0040_doctor_05",
      "hash": "d72bd87e07085de2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 4]"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0040_doctor_03",
      "hash": "d72bd27e070853b0",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "OAK: Hey! Where do you think you’re going?\\nBack over here, young [VAR GENDBR(00FF,0403)]manlady!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0040_rival_02",
      "hash": "14283ebd92c1b1c4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 6]"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0040_new_rival_01",
      "hash": "300dda520826e5ae",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR RIVALNAME(0001)]: Professor Oak!\\c\\nThose Poké Balls there—I swear there were only\\ntwo a second ago, but now there are three!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0040_new_doctor_01",
      "hash": "4e6eefdd0a5feaff",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "OAK: A perfectly reasonable reaction, my boy!\\nYou see, one of them is [VAR INDEF_ART(0002)][VAR POKNAME(0002)] that\\r\\n[VAR TRNAME(0000)] caught just now."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main0040_new_rival_02",
      "hash": "300dd9520826e3fb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR RIVALNAME(0001)]: So, wait, [VAR TRNAME(0000)]...\\nYou caught it yourself?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main0040_new_rival_03",
      "hash": "300dd8520826e248",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Wha—?! I’ve never seen that happen before!"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main0040_new_doctor_02",
      "hash": "4e6ef0dd0a5fecb2",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "OAK: Hohoho! How interesting!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main0040_new_doctor_04",
      "hash": "4e6eeadd0a5fe280",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Well, my [VAR GENDBR(00FF,0403)]boygirl, this is it! Take that Poké Ball—\\nand keep good hold of it this time!"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main0040_new_doctor_03",
      "hash": "4e6ef1dd0a5fee65",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Go on!\\n[VAR POKNAME(0002)] is yours now!"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main0040_new_rival_04",
      "hash": "300ddf520826ee2d",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I think the Pokémon you caught is in the middle\\nPoké Ball, [VAR TRNAME(0000)]."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_main0040_new_rival_05",
      "hash": "300dde520826ec7a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR RIVALNAME(0001)]: I think it’s trying to tell you\\nyou’re going for the wrong one, pal!"
    }
  ],
